2. Tuning Obstacle Avoidance
The robot is currently set to react when an object is 20cm away.

Change Detection Distance
Find this line in the loop() and change the number:
if (distance < 30) { // Increased to 30cm for faster robots

Change Escape Maneuvers
You can adjust the delay() values to make the robot turn wider or reverse longer:
reverseCar();
delay(1000); // Reverses for 1 second instead of 0.5s
turnRight();
delay(300);  // Sharper, shorter turn
